+  margin-block-start: 1.25rem;
+}
+
+/* [A-16] /invoice on a phone: the table is min-w-[34rem] (544 px) inside a 254-364 px scroller, so the unit price, the line
+ * totals and all the totals rows are off-screen at the inline end, with nothing to say it scrolls. Let it fit the screen
+ * below 640 px; from 640 px nothing changes. (At 320 px the table still needs about 50 px more than the card has: that
+ * width keeps its sideways scroll.) */
